      "text": "<math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>9</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mo>,</mo><mn>9,9</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>",
      "image": null,
