    },
    {
      "id": "s0f3g",
      "text": "<math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>9</mn><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "mFsgE",
      "text": "<math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>9</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mfrac><mrow><mn>9</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Let, equation of the plane is <math><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo></math></p><p>Mid-point <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></math> of line joining&nbsp;<math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1,2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> and <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3,4</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> is <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1,3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>.</mo></math></p><p>It lies on the plane i.e.<br /><math><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br />Also, <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi></math> is parallel to the normal of the plane, so,<br /><math><mfrac><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>18</mn></mfrac></math><br />i.e.&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>9</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn></math><br />Hence, ordered pair is&nbsp;<math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mn>9,9</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p>",
